{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/batchstrategy"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"BatchStrategy","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Afluent"}],"platforms":[{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"iPadOS","introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst","introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"13.0","unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"9.0","unavailable":false}],"roleHeading":"Protocol","externalID":"s:7Afluent13BatchStrategyP","symbolKind":"protocol","remoteSource":{"fileName":"BatchStrategy.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/SequenceOperators\/BatchStrategy.swift#L56"},"fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BatchStrategy","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"BatchStrategy"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Associated Types","anchor":"Associated-Types","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/Element"],"generated":true},{"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/flushes(pending:)","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/run(_:)"],"generated":true},{"title":"Type Methods","anchor":"Type-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/count(_:)","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/either(_:_:)","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/signal(_:)-5ofce","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/signal(_:)-88w9i","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/signal(_:)-eomf","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/time(interval:clock:tolerance:)"],"generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BatchStrategy","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent13BatchStrategyP7ElementQa"},{"text":"> : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sendable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A strategy flushes the pending elements as one array in either of two ways: when an element"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"arrives, by returning "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" from "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/flushes(pending:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", or on events of its own (a timer, a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"signal), by calling "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchFlusher\/flush()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" from "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/run(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". After every flush, whatever its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cause, each strategy starts over. A flush with nothing pending emits nothing."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The built-in strategies are "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CountBatchStrategy","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/TimeBatchStrategy","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/SignalBatchStrategy","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" (over a sequence or a unit of work) and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/EitherBatchStrategy","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"spelled "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".count(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".time(interval:clock:tolerance:)"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".signal(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".either(_:_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"where a strategy is expected."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Up to 100 events per upload, and at least one upload every 5 seconds while events arrive.","let events = analyticsEvents.batch(strategy: .either(","    .count(100),","    .time(interval: .seconds(5), clock: ContinuousClock())))","for try await batch in events {","    try await upload(batch)","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Writing a strategy","anchor":"Writing-a-strategy","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Conform a type to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BatchStrategy"},{"type":"text","text":" and implement either requirement, or both; each has a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default that never flushes. Implement "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/flushes(pending:)"},{"type":"text","text":" to decide from the pending"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"elements, after each one arrives. Implement "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/run(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" to flush on events of your own: it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"runs in a task of its own while the batched sequence is iterated, and is cancelled when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"batched sequence ends. A custom strategy composes with the built-in ones in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".either(_:_:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Element"},{"type":"text","text":" is the batched sequence’s element: name it in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"flushes(pending:)"},{"type":"text","text":", or make the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"strategy generic over it when only "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy\/run(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" matters."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/\/ Flushes after each line, so every batch ends at a line break.","struct LineBatchStrategy: BatchStrategy {","    func flushes(pending: [Character]) -> Bool {","        pending.last == \"\\n\"","    }","}","","\/\/ A batch per line, or whatever has arrived after a second without one.","let lines = characters.batch(strategy: .either(","    LineBatchStrategy(),","    .time(interval: .seconds(1), clock: ContinuousClock())))"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Batching needs iOS 16, Mac Catalyst 16, macOS 13, tvOS 16, watchOS 9 or visionOS 1."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/BatchStrategy","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent"]]},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type"